In the
late nineteen-seventies,

5
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:12,100
they drifted into a
favourable alignment,

6
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:14,900
one that comes around
roughly once every hundred

7
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:16,267
and seventy-five years.

8
